                    <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="6b2a8df2-cb0b-5493-974f-d27207ce83fd">This model gains A+3, but each roll of a 1 To Hit inflicts 1 Mortal Wound. Lasts until your next Psychic Phase.</characteristic>
