                    <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="6b2a8df2-cb0b-5493-974f-d27207ce83fd">Remove one Friendly model from the game within 6”. Heal one Friendly model within 6” d3 Wounds. This is an exception to the usual Heal rule of Healing 1.</characteristic>
