        <rule id="d8268c98-0820-5e87-bd47-158e5c774b1d" name="Fester" hidden="false">
          <description>Models with Fester automatically fail Invulnerability Saves and Feel No Pains. In each of your command phases, roll 1d6 per model in the unit with Fester. On a 6+, spawn 1 additional like model with the same unit wide upgrades and place it in this model’s unit, even if it exceeds its maximum size.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
