                        <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="6b2a8df2-cb0b-5493-974f-d27207ce83fd">Assault 1, Sniper (2+), If target Independent Character dies, place a Chaos Spawn (no upgrades) in their place. If they were part of a unit, the unit is considered to be in Ongoing Melee and Engaged.</characteristic>
