                    <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="6b2a8df2-cb0b-5493-974f-d27207ce83fd">Summon 10 Bloodletters as if they had just arrived from Deepstrike, but they do not Scatter. This cannot be Cast on Turn 1.</characteristic>
