                    <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="6b2a8df2-cb0b-5493-974f-d27207ce83fd">Target unit with the Mark of Tzeentch immediately deploys out of Reserves within 18” of the Caster. This can happen on Turn 1.</characteristic>
