        <rule id="50c4d473-fdae-514b-99a1-fbd43ec9ee55" name="Slashing Attack" hidden="false">
          <description>In the Movement Phase, if this model Moves over one or more enemy units that are not Engaged in Melee, inflict d3 S4</description>
